            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "日本10月CPI通脹上升，核心數據略低於預期",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"東京通脹9月加速升溫，日本央行進一步加息預期升溫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5f741f898c48efc603ba7c7f53895f569d17db7ba23b06a8fb450b7d90284776/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEB3Q0G9_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">東京通脹9月加速升溫，日本央行進一步加息預期升溫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com — 日本10月消費者通脹率因鮮食價格大幅上漲而走高，核心通脹率雖略低於市場預期，但仍維持在日本央行（BOJ）目標水準之上。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">日本統計局週五公布的數據顯示，剔除鮮食及能源價格的核心消費者物價指數（CPI）於10月按年增長2.2%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此數據略低於市場預期的2.3%，但較上月的2.1%有所上升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">同時剔除能源與鮮食價格的核心讀數於10月增長2.2%，較上月的2.4%有所回落。該數據被日本央行視為衡量潛在通脹的重要指標，備受市場關注。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-93200eb3-c31d-3f80-bc3e-3c567943b5c6-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">整體CPI從9月的2.1%上升至10月的2.3%。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">10月鮮食價格大幅攀升，成為推動整體通脹的主要動力，而儘管政府對燃料及公用事業提供補貼，能源價格亦同步回升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">週五公布的數據顯示，通脹率持續穩定地高於日本央行2%的目標，進一步強化了市場對央行將於12月議息會議上加息的預期。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">日本央行在10月的議息會議上實際上宣告了其對抗通縮之戰的勝利，表示通脹預計將持續維持在2%目標附近或以上水準。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">受中東戰事持續推高燃料及原材料成本影響，日本通脹今年以來持續穩步上升。儘管日本政府對燃料及公用事業實施補貼以緩解高物價對消費者的衝擊，但企業成本已大幅上漲，預計相關壓力已逐步轉嫁至消費者身上。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC10%E6%9C%88cpi%E9%80%9A%E8%84%B9%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E7%95%A5%E4%BD%8E%E6%96%BC%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F-004531070.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 09:04:06",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜AI股急瀉觸發套現 金價四連跌見今年低位",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜AI股急瀉觸發套現 金價四連跌見今年低位\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜AI股急瀉觸發套現 金價四連跌見今年低位</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">現貨金價連跌四日，一度低見每盎司3,620.11美元，創今年低位，較1月底高位5,595.47美元累跌逾35%。AI股份急挫引發基金去槓桿及套現需求，黃金成為變現工具，避險作用暫未顯現。標普500指數跌2%，逾460隻成分股下滑。聯儲局偏鷹、美元走強及美債孳息上升，亦加大金價下行壓力。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-ai%E8%82%A1%E6%80%A5%E7%80%89%E8%A7%B8%E7%99%BC%E5%A5%97%E7%8F%BE-%E9%87%91%E5%83%B9%E5%9B%9B%E9%80%A3%E8%B7%8C%E8%A6%8B%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E4%BD%8E%E4%BD%8D-000053747.html",
